    "title": "CDIF Version 1.1 Now Final",
    "link": "https://codata.org/cdif-version-1-1-now-final/",
    "pubDate": "2026-09-11T10:20:50.000Z",
    "content": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignright wp-image-13178\" src=\"https://codata.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cdif640-transparent.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"286\" height=\"143\">After the initial release of the CDIF version 1.1 Profiles in June, and a subsequent round of testing and implementation, they have now been finalised. The release will henceforth be stable, with all further issues and features addressed in subsequent versions. The release can be found at <a href=\"https://book.cdif.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://book.cdif.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SV-umUHRCGrpzeA2u8oO0\">https://book.cdif.org/</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Cross-Domain-Interoperability-Framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://github.com/Cross-Domain-Interoperability-Framework&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0S3F9YhsKvVx5JQ6aLG6fa\"><wbr>https://github.com/Cross-<wbr>Domain-Interoperability-<wbr>Framework</a></p>\n<p>Version 1.1 consists of profiles for JSON-LD implementation in support of cross-domain FAIR systems and applications:</p>\n<p><b>Core</b>&nbsp;(<a href=\"http://schema.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://schema.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07BorI4VORu0MKNTYHYxUZ\">Schema.org</a>) – basic general and administrative metadata<br>\n<b>Discovery</b>&nbsp;(<a href=\"http://schema.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://schema.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07BorI4VORu0MKNTYHYxUZ\">Schema.org</a>) – support for detailed cataloging and search<br>\n<b>Concept Scheme</b>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03NHUg54QtfOsmzZ7VSWw5\">SKOS</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/OWL/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.w3.org/OWL/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2T_BHTT7e9-Qht15_VvwXh\">OWL</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26gOY26gLnIEiiAQXVqqk_\">XKOS</a>) – Ontologies, glossaries, and other types of controlled vocabularies<br>\n<b>Codelist</b>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03NHUg54QtfOsmzZ7VSWw5\">SKOS</a>) – enumerated values for populating variables<br>\n<b>Data Description</b>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://schema.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://schema.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13REWxLMPcPdmsRujKgvbD\">Schema.org</a>/<a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/ddi-cdi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://ddialliance.org/ddi-cdi&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38PFpMtrJpp_sXCw5b7ZmC\">DDI-<wbr>CDI</a>) – describing data sets, including structural and physical information, plus links to semantics<br>\n<b>Data Structure</b>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/ddi-cdi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://ddialliance.org/ddi-cdi&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38PFpMtrJpp_sXCw5b7ZmC\">DDI-CDI</a>) – description of reusable data structures and variables<br>\n<b>Manifest</b>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://www.researchobject.org/ro-crate/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.researchobject.org/ro-crate/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789208321683000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eGaBAST9ibdf8kM9BZ1kU\">RO Crate</a>) – Packaging of related sets of metadata and data</p>",
